From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:38:15 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 60/63] Meridian 0.5.7: Arc's sidebar proportions, + menu,
 downloads in the corner
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Rows 40px with 14px text and 18px icons, sidebar 276px; the space's icon
  and name line up with the rows' icons and titles.
- Favorites share the row's width (one spans it), without the ring and dot.
- The + opens Arc's menu: New Space, New Folder, New Split, New Tab, then
  Workbench and Mission Control (the + turns into ×). Mission Control shows
  at the bottom only while agents run.
- The bottom-left corner holds the downloads instead of Chrome's menu.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
